sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Recruiter
    participant A as LangGraph agent
    participant C as MCPClient
    participant F as filesystem server
    participant D as candidate_db server
    participant L as Claude

    Note over A,D: Start-up (build_graph)
    A->>C: get_mcp_client()
    C->>F: initialize / tools/list
    C->>D: initialize / tools/list
    C->>F: tools/call watch_directory(timeout 0) — first snapshot

    Note over R,L: Screening run
    R->>A: "it_systems_admin"
    A->>C: parse_jd
    C->>F: tools/call read_file(job_descriptions/it_systems_admin.txt)
    A->>L: extract_requirements
    A->>A: search_resumes + rank_candidates (local RAG index)
    A->>C: deep_analysis
    C->>F: tools/call batch_process(10 resume paths)
    F-->>C: 10 texts in one response
    A->>L: 10 analyses in parallel, then final decisions
    A->>C: generate_report
    C->>F: tools/call write_file(reports/...md)
    C->>D: tools/call save_screening(...)
    A-->>R: summary table (graph pauses: interrupt)

    Note over R,L: Question turn
    R->>A: "Check for new resumes"
    A->>L: answer_question (MCP tools + agent tools bound)
    L-->>A: tool call check_new_resumes
    A->>C: watch_directory(resumes, 30 s)
    C->>F: tools/call watch_directory
    F-->>C: progress notifications ... new_files
    C->>F: tools/call batch_process(new files)
    A->>L: analyse new resumes
    A-->>R: answer
